@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = kr-dev-key

### Ping: HTTP 200, code=0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ping

### Configuration write without a key: HTTP 403, code=4031
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app": "demo-app",
  "env": "dev",
  "key": "unauthorized.example",
  "value": "blocked"
}

### Create configuration: HTTP 200, version=1 on a fresh server
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app": "demo-app",
  "env": "dev",
  "key": "db.pool.size",
  "value": "10",
  "description": "pool size",
  "operator": "demo",
  "reason": "initial value"
}

### Update configuration: HTTP 200, version=2 after the create above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app": "demo-app",
  "env": "dev",
  "key": "db.pool.size",
  "value": "20",
  "description": "larger pool",
  "expectedVersion": 1,
  "operator": "demo",
  "reason": "tune pool"
}

### Stale configuration update: HTTP 409, code=4091
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app": "demo-app",
  "env": "dev",
  "key": "db.pool.size",
  "value": "999",
  "expectedVersion": 1,
  "operator": "demo",
  "reason": "expected conflict"
}

### List configurations: copy the ETag response header for the next request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/configs?app=demo-app&env=dev

### Conditional list: replace the value with the ETag copied above; expected HTTP 304
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/configs?app=demo-app&env=dev
If-None-Match: W/"replace-with-current-etag"

### Read one configuration; dotted keys are supported
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/configs/db.pool.size?app=demo-app&env=dev

### Read configuration history; newest snapshot is first, default limit=50 (1..200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/configs/history?app=demo-app&env=dev&key=db.pool.size&limit=20

### Read the next configuration-history page; beforeVersion is exclusive
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/configs/history?app=demo-app&env=dev&key=db.pool.size&limit=20&beforeVersion=20

### Roll back configuration version 1 as a new version; API Key is required
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/configs/rollback
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app": "demo-app",
  "env": "dev",
  "key": "db.pool.size",
  "targetVersion": 1,
  "operator": "demo",
  "reason": "restore initial value"
}

### Watch configuration namespace revision; latestVersion is not an item version
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/configs/watch?app=demo-app&env=dev&sinceVersion=0&timeoutSeconds=1

### Create Feature Flag: HTTP 200, version=1 on a fresh server
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/features
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app": "demo-app",
  "env": "dev",
  "name": "new-checkout",
  "enabled": true,
  "rolloutPercentage": 30,
  "allowlist": ["u1000", "u2000"],
  "operator": "demo",
  "reason": "initial rule"
}

### List Feature Flags
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/features?app=demo-app&env=dev

### Allowlist evaluation: enabled=true, bucket=-1, decision=allowlist 命中
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/features/evaluate?app=demo-app&env=dev&name=new-checkout&userId=u1000

### Percentage evaluation: stable bucket for the same user and feature
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/features/evaluate?app=demo-app&env=dev&name=new-checkout&userId=u3000

### Read Feature Flag history; newest snapshot is first, default limit=50 (1..200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/features/history?app=demo-app&env=dev&name=new-checkout&limit=20

### Read the next Feature-Flag-history page; beforeVersion is exclusive
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/features/history?app=demo-app&env=dev&name=new-checkout&limit=20&beforeVersion=20

### Roll back Feature Flag version 1 as a new version; API Key is required
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/features/rollback
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app": "demo-app",
  "env": "dev",
  "name": "new-checkout",
  "targetVersion": 1,
  "operator": "demo",
  "reason": "restore initial rule"
}

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Metrics catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics

### Actuator uses base meter names; Prometheus adds `_total` to counter samples
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/config_center_rate_limit_blocked

### Current pending configuration-watch waiters
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/config_center_watch_pending

### Current namespaces with pending configuration-watch waiters
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/config_center_watch_namespaces

### Configuration-watch registrations rejected for capacity
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/config_center_watch_rejected

### Prometheus exposition
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
